{"unit_id": "tag:04DC:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下述定义其实是多余的，因为普遍同胚（universal homeomorphism）其实就是整的（integral）、普遍为单射（injective）且为满射（surjective）的态射（morphism），见引理 <REF_0001>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "universal homeomorphism", "target_term": "普遍同胚"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整的"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "universal homeomorphism", "target_term": "普遍同胚", "context": "经任意基变换仍为同胚的态射"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整的", "context": "刻画普遍同胚的整性条件"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射", "context": "普遍单射条件中的单射性"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "刻画普遍同胚的满射条件"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "概形之间的态射"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:04DD:statement", "translation": "概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>普遍同胚（universal homeomorphism）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果基变换（base change）<MATH_0002>对每个态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>都是同胚（homeomorphism）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "universal homeomorphism", "target_term": "普遍同胚"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "homeomorphism", "target_term": "同胚"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的源与目标所属的范畴"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所定义性质的对象"}, {"source_term": "universal homeomorphism", "target_term": "普遍同胚", "context": "本条定义的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "沿给定态射所作的基变换"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "供基变换使用的任意态射"}, {"source_term": "homeomorphism", "target_term": "同胚", "context": "要求基变换所得映射满足的性质"}], "notes": []}
