{"unit_id": "tag:04DE:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。若<MATH_0002>给出到<MATH_0003>的一个闭子集（closed subset）上的同胚（homeomorphism），则<MATH_0004>是仿射的（affine）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "homeomorphism", "target_term": "同胚"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理中考虑的态射的源与目标所属的范畴"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理所考察的概形态射"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "同胚所映到的闭子集"}, {"source_term": "homeomorphism", "target_term": "同胚", "context": "态射在底层拓扑空间上满足的条件"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的", "context": "引理推出的态射性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:04DE:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为一点（point）。若<MATH_0002>，则存在<MATH_0003>的一个仿射的（affine）邻域（neighbourhood），它与<MATH_0004>不相交（disjoint）。\n若<MATH_0005>，设<MATH_0006>是<MATH_0007>中唯一映到（mapping）<MATH_0008>的点（point）。\n设<MATH_0009>为一个仿射开（affine open）邻域（neighbourhood）。\n设<MATH_0010>为<MATH_0011>的一个仿射开（affine open）邻域（neighbourhood），它映入（maps）<MATH_0012>。\n<MATH_0013>在诱导的拓扑（topology）中是开的（open），这是由对<MATH_0014>的假设得出的，故可选取<MATH_0015>，使得<MATH_0016>且<MATH_0017>。\n记<MATH_0018>为<MATH_0019>在<MATH_0020>上的限制（restriction）。于是可见<MATH_0021>等于<MATH_0022>。\n换言之，<MATH_0023>的每一点（point）都有一个开（open）邻域（neighbourhood），其逆（inverse）像（image）是仿射的（affine）。\n因此<MATH_0024>是仿射的（affine），见引理 <REF_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "disjoint", "target_term": "不相交"}, {"source_term": "mapping", "target_term": "映到"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映入"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开的"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "选择用于局部论证的点"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的", "context": "目标概形邻域的性质"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "选取的点的邻域"}, {"source_term": "disjoint", "target_term": "不相交", "context": "所选邻域与指定子集的关系"}, {"source_term": "mapping", "target_term": "映到", "context": "说明唯一点的映射去向"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "源概形中由像唯一确定的点"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开", "context": "第一个邻域的仿射性与开性"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "首先选定的开邻域"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开", "context": "第二个邻域的仿射性与开性"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "第二个指定点的邻域"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映入", "context": "说明第二个邻域的映射去向"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "指定子集的诱导拓扑"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开的", "context": "在诱导拓扑中的开性"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制", "context": "将给定态射限制到给定部分所得的态射"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "逐点验证仿射性时任取的点"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "所选邻域的开性"}, {"source_term": "neighbourhood", "target_term": "邻域", "context": "逐点选取的开邻域"}, {"source_term": "inverse", "target_term": "逆", "context": "与像合成逆像，指态射下的原像"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "与逆合成逆像，指态射下的原像"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的", "context": "开邻域逆像的性质"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的", "context": "所要证明的态射性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:04DF:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。下列条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002>是普遍同胚（universal homeomorphism），且\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0003>是整的（integral）、普遍为单射（injective）且为满射（surjective）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "universal homeomorphism", "target_term": "普遍同胚"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整的"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "态射的源与目标所属的范畴"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "下列等价性质所针对的对象"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "指两条条件可相互推出"}, {"source_term": "universal homeomorphism", "target_term": "普遍同胚", "context": "等价条件之一"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整的", "context": "另一条件所要求的整性"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射", "context": "另一条件所要求的普遍单射性"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "另一条件所要求的满射性"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:04DF:proof", "translation": "假设<MATH_0001>是普遍同胚（universal homeomorphism）。由引理 <REF_0001> 可知<MATH_0002>是仿射的（affine）。由于<MATH_0003>显然是普遍闭的（universally closed），<MATH_0004>由引理 <REF_0002> 可知是整的（integral）。显然<MATH_0005>也普遍为单射（injective）且为满射（surjective）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n假设<MATH_0006>是整的（integral）、普遍为单射（injective）且为满射（surjective）。由引理 <REF_0003>，<MATH_0007>是普遍闭的（universally closed）。由于它还普遍为双射（bijective）（见引理 <REF_0004>），所以它是普遍同胚（universal homeomorphism）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "universal homeomorphism", "target_term": "普遍同胚"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}, {"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "普遍闭的"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整的"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整的"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "普遍闭的"}, {"source_term": "bijective", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "universal homeomorphism", "target_term": "普遍同胚"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "universal homeomorphism", "target_term": "普遍同胚", "context": "第一方向的假设"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的", "context": "从引理得到的第一项性质"}, {"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "普遍闭的", "context": "与仿射性一起推出整性的性质"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整的", "context": "第一方向需要推出的整性"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射", "context": "第一方向得到的普遍单射性"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "第一方向得到的满射性"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整的", "context": "反方向的整性假设"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射", "context": "反方向的普遍单射性假设"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "反方向的满射性假设"}, {"source_term": "universally closed", "target_term": "普遍闭的", "context": "由整性借助引理推出的性质"}, {"source_term": "bijective", "target_term": "双射", "context": "结合普遍闭性推出结论的普遍双射性"}, {"source_term": "universal homeomorphism", "target_term": "普遍同胚", "context": "反方向要证明的性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:054M:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。典范（canonical）闭浸入（closed immersion）<MATH_0002>（见《概形（Schemes）》中的定义 <REF_0001>）是普遍同胚（universal homeomorphism）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "universal homeomorphism", "target_term": "普遍同胚"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "用以构造典范闭浸入的概形"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "说明闭浸入由给定概形自然确定"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "引理所考察的典范态射"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引用定义所在章节的标题"}, {"source_term": "universal homeomorphism", "target_term": "普遍同胚", "context": "典范闭浸入所具有的性质"}], "notes": []}
