{"unit_id": "tag:0896:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）。假设\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0003>是闭浸入（closed immersion），\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0004>在点（points）上是双射（bijective），\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0005>是闭浸入（closed immersion），且\n<STRUCT_0005> <MATH_0006>是有限型（finite type）的，或<MATH_0007>是有限表示（finite presentation）的。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n那么<MATH_0008>是闭浸入（closed immersion）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "bijective", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理所考察态射的源与目标所属的范畴"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引理开头给定的两个态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "第一项假设中的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点", "context": "双射性涉及的底层点"}, {"source_term": "bijective", "target_term": "双射", "context": "第二项假设中的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "第三项假设中的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "第四项假设中的第一种情形"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "第四项假设中的第二种情形"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "引理结论中的态射性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0896:proof", "translation": "由假设（1）和（2）可知<MATH_0001>是普遍同胚（universal homeomorphism）（例如，由<MATH_0002>并应用引理 <REF_0001> 即可得出）。\n因此，由（3）可知<MATH_0003>给出到<MATH_0004>的一个闭子集（closed subset）上的同胚（homeomorphism）。于是<MATH_0005>是仿射的（affine），这由引理 <REF_0002> 得出。\n设<MATH_0006>为一个仿射开集（affine open），记为<MATH_0007>。则由（1）有<MATH_0008>，其中<MATH_0009>由（2）可知是局部幂零（locally nilpotent）理想（ideal）。由于<MATH_0010>是仿射的（affine），可知<MATH_0011>。\n由假设（4）可知，<MATH_0012>是<MATH_0013>上的有限型（finite type）代数（algebra）（引理 <REF_0003>），或<MATH_0014>是有限生成的（finitely generated）（引理 <REF_0004>）。\n假设（3）是说<MATH_0015>是满射（surjective）。由《代数（Algebra）》中的引理 <REF_0005>（若<MATH_0016>是有限型（finite type）的），或由《代数（Algebra）》中的引理 <REF_0006>（若<MATH_0017>是有限生成的（finitely generated），从而是幂零的（nilpotent）），可推出<MATH_0018>是满射（surjective）。\n这意味着<MATH_0019>是闭浸入（closed immersion），见引理 <REF_0007>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "universal homeomorphism", "target_term": "普遍同胚"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "homeomorphism", "target_term": "同胚"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "locally nilpotent", "target_term": "局部幂零"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "finitely generated", "target_term": "有限生成的"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "finitely generated", "target_term": "有限生成的"}, {"source_term": "nilpotent", "target_term": "幂零的"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "universal homeomorphism", "target_term": "普遍同胚", "context": "由前两项假设得出的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "第三项假设所给同胚的像"}, {"source_term": "homeomorphism", "target_term": "同胚", "context": "态射到闭子集的拓扑性质"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的", "context": "由到闭子集的同胚得出的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "作局部计算所选的开集"}, {"source_term": "locally nilpotent", "target_term": "局部幂零", "context": "由第二项假设可知的理想性质"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想", "context": "确定闭浸入的理想"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射的", "context": "用于描述局部代数的仿射性"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "第四项假设给出的第一种代数条件"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "第一种情形中考虑的代数"}, {"source_term": "finitely generated", "target_term": "有限生成的", "context": "第四项假设给出的第二种代数条件"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "第三项假设给出的满射性"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "第一条所引引理所在章节的标题"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "应用第一条代数引理的情形"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "第二条所引引理所在章节的标题"}, {"source_term": "finitely generated", "target_term": "有限生成的", "context": "应用第二条代数引理的情形"}, {"source_term": "nilpotent", "target_term": "幂零的", "context": "第二种情形中由有限生成性推出的性质"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "两条代数引理所推出的性质"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入", "context": "由满射性得出的态射性质"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0H2M:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是两个态射（morphisms）<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>的复合（composition）。若态射（morphisms）<MATH_0004>中有两个是普遍同胚（universal homeomorphisms），则第三个态射（morphism）也是。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "universal homeomorphisms", "target_term": "普遍同胚"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "参与复合的两个态射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "由两个给定态射得到的态射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "比较性质的三个态射"}, {"source_term": "universal homeomorphisms", "target_term": "普遍同胚", "context": "在三个态射中的两个上假设的性质"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "结论所指的第三个态射"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0H2M:proof", "translation": "若<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>都是普遍同胚（universal homeomorphisms），则<MATH_0003>也是，这由引理 <REF_0001> 得出。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n假设<MATH_0004>和<MATH_0005>都是普遍同胚（universal homeomorphisms）。我们要证明<MATH_0006>也是。现沿任意概形（schemes）态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>对该图表（diagram）作基变换（base change），得到下列图表（diagram），其中各方块（squares）都是笛卡尔的（Cartesian）：\n<MATH_0008>\n由假设可知，复合（composition）<MATH_0009>和<MATH_0010>都是同胚（homeomorphisms），所以<MATH_0011>也是。于是证得<MATH_0012>是普遍同胚（universal homeomorphism）。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n最后，假设<MATH_0013>和<MATH_0014>都是普遍同胚（universal homeomorphisms）。我们要证明<MATH_0015>是普遍同胚（universal homeomorphism）。设<MATH_0016>为任意概形（schemes）态射（morphism）。得到下列图表（diagram），其中各方块（squares）都是笛卡尔的（Cartesian）：\n<MATH_0017>\n这里，态射（morphism）<MATH_0018>由纤维积（fiber products）的泛性质（universal property）及两个态射（morphisms）<MATH_0019>和<MATH_0020>定义。我们将证明<MATH_0021>是同胚（homeomorphism）。\n由于同胚（homeomorphism）具有三取二性质（2-out-of-3 property），可知<MATH_0022>是同胚（homeomorphism）。考察最上方的方块（square），只需证明<MATH_0023>是普遍同胚（universal homeomorphism）。由于<MATH_0024>是同胚（homeomorphism），由引理 <REF_0002> 可知它是仿射的（affine）态射（morphism），因而更是分离的（separated）（引理 <REF_0003>）。\n由于<MATH_0025>是恒等态射（identity），所以<MATH_0026>是闭浸入（closed immersion），这由《概形（Schemes）》中的引理 <REF_0004> 得出。\n由于<MATH_0027>是双射（bijective），所以<MATH_0028>是双射的（bijective）闭浸入（closed immersion），从而是普遍同胚（universal homeomorphism）（例如，可由引理 <REF_0005> 中的刻画得出），这正是所要证明的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "universal homeomorphisms", "target_term": "普遍同胚"}, {"source_term": "universal homeomorphisms", "target_term": "普遍同胚"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图表"}, {"source_term": "squares", "target_term": "方块"}, {"source_term": "Cartesian", "target_term": "笛卡尔的"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_te